si le versement des revenus locatifs, que le logement soit occupé ou non.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire ou pour organiser une visite, n'hésitez pas à contacter Acumen Patrimoine.\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"2 Rue de Gavrinis","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijc2YmE5NGM5MGRiYzZmMzYzZWU5MDY3ZTRmZjcxZTIzZWU4ZWY4MzgiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiYzdkNjMxMWUyN2E2MDAzMzA2N2MyY2E5NzhmMTM5NyJ9?signature=9ea3f13ca1d7b66fbbe2df47dd53d38b0d3908b1735b002547ab23d6d441bddd","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImRlZGNhOGJiMzlmNjZhMjJjMTQzNmEwMzAzOTAyMDMyODkyNGI4MDUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI0MWJjYjgxYmYzYjM3NTZiOGFjNDJmMWMwMTY1NDhhOCJ9?signature=0c3c89fcaa50b924fa0db58454f829f154b26a64929b86cdbda0d2d014f63b1d","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjI1OTNiOTNjNWVmZjc1Mzc1MTA3NDA0ZWQwY2UyYzQ5MWQ4ZDI1MjciLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4MGQ4MTFlNmM4NmZmYWQyYzk5NzEzZmFhYjc5ZjdhYSJ9?signature=09ccb5d21d40d216e52782fb2f7610ec146d604dc15ceb2247bcb60ad9d5bdb3","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImU5ZTZmMGIzMzEyOWU1OGEyMGJiMWEwNDkzYTE3ZDdlNGRlZWViZWYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI1ZTk2NjFjMTczNmFiNmU3Nzg2MGEyMjI0MzgyMTk3MCJ9?signature=13940083c9c87badfeade6d7d2ce2816bb4206f48774400f199cff877e348e98","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjQ0OTkwZWZlOWEzZWUyZjBiYTQ1MzcxOGZkYmVhMzk3OTUxNjYxOWMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Iml